  "releaseNotes": "v.1.0.0-preview.84\n- Fix: Resolved an error in the accessibility panel where the axe-core check result could not be retrieved under certain conditions.\n- Fix: Prevented Blazor Server circuit disconnects in the accessibility panel when accessibility scan results are large.\n- Improve: Improved accessibility re-scan behavior by clearing stale results only when result delivery is delayed, reducing visual flicker during story changes.\n\nTo see all the change logs, please visit the following URL.\n- https://github.com/jsakamoto/BlazingStory/blob/main/RELEASE-NOTES.txt",
